#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:23
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Phobos T3"
msgstr "Phobos T3"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:24 scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:129
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:189
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:215
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:265
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:313
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:390
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:467
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:489
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:556
msgctxt "class"
msgid "Frigate"
msgstr "Fregatte"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:24
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Patrol"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:29
msgid ""
"The Phobos T3 is the workhorse of almost any navy. Its basic stats aren't "
"impressive, but its modular nature makes it easy to rapidly manufacture it "
"in large quantities and modify it for a variety of mission profiles."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:46
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Elara P2"
msgstr "Elara P2"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:50
msgid ""
"Inspired by the Phobos T3's design, the Elara P2 adds a warp drive and "
"stronger front shields."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:59
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Phobos M3"
msgstr "Phobos M3"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:64
msgid ""
"The Phobos M3 is one of the most common variants of the Phobos T3. It adds a "
"mine-laying tube, but the extra storage required for the mines slows this "
"ship down slightly."
msgstr ""
"Die Phobos M3 ist eine der gebräuchlichsten Varianten der Phobos T3. Im "
"Vergleich dazu verfügt die M3 über einen zusätzlichen Minenschacht, die "
"dadurch bedingte höhere Masse macht sie allerdings ein wenig langsamer."

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:78
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "Phobos M3P"
msgstr "Phobos M3P"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:83
msgid ""
"This variant of the Phobos M3 has front-firing weapon tubes, making it an "
"easier-to-use ship in some scenarios."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:128
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Nirvana R5"
msgstr "Nirvana R5"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:129
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Anti-fighter"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:134
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:154
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:172
msgid ""
"The Nirvana series of anti-fighter frigates have several rapid-firing, low-"
"damage point-defense weapons to quickly take out starfighters."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:136
msgid ""
"Compared to the older, rarer Nirvana R3, it has longer beam range, stronger "
"shields and hull, and a faster impulse drive. Its successor, the R5A, has a "
"faster turning speed and firing rates."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:150
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Nirvana R5A"
msgstr "Nirvana R5A"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:156
msgid ""
"This improved version of the Nirvana R5 has a faster turning speed and "
"firing rates."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:168
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Nirvana R3"
msgstr "Nirvana R3"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:174
msgid ""
"Compared to the newer, more common Nirvana R5, it has shorter beams, weaker "
"shields and hull, and a slower impulse drive."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:188
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Storm"
msgstr "Storm"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:189
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:265
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Artillery"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:194
msgid ""
"A heavy artillery frigate, the Storm fires volleys of missiles from forward-"
"facing tubes."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:214
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "Hathcock"
msgstr "Hathcock"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:215
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:467
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Sniper"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:221
msgid ""
"The Hathcock has a long-range beam weapon with a narrow arc, as well as "
"point-defense beams and a versatile stock of broadside missiles. Agile for a "
"frigate."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:264
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Piranha F12"
msgstr "Piranha F12"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:270
msgid ""
"A light artillery frigate, the Piranha F12 is the smallest ship to fire "
"exclusively from broadside weapon tubes."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:297
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Piranha F12.M"
msgstr "Piranha F12.M"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:301
msgid ""
"This Piranha F12 variant has specially modified weapon tubes that allow it "
"to fire nukes in addition to its normal loadout. However, these changes "
"reduce its overall missile storage capacity."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:311
msgctxt "playerShip"
msgid "Piranha"
msgstr "Piranha"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:313
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:556
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Assault"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:317
msgid ""
"This combat-specialized Piranha F12 adds mine-laying tubes, combat "
"maneuvering systems, and a jump drive."
msgstr ""
"Diese auf den Kampf spezialisierte Piranha besitzt zusätzliche "
"Minenschächte, ein Ausweichmanöver-system und einen Sprungantrieb."

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:371
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Piranha F8"
msgstr "Piranha F8"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:375
msgid ""
"The first version of the Piranha wasn't popular due to its meager firepower "
"and odd tube configuration. The result was a huge financial failure."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:389
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Stalker Q7"
msgstr "Stalker Q7"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:390
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:489
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Strike"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:396
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:417
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:435
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:452
msgid ""
"Ships of the Stalker line are designed to swoop into battle, deal damage "
"quickly, and get out fast."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:398
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:419
msgid "The Q series is fitted with a warp drive."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:400
msgid ""
"Compared to its predecessor, the Q5, the Q7 has stronger shields and hull "
"but a slower turning rate."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:413
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Stalker Q5"
msgstr "Stalker Q5"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:421
msgid ""
"Compared to its successor, the Q7, the Q5 has weaker shields and hull but a "
"faster turning rate."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:431
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Stalker R7"
msgstr "Stalker R7"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:437
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:454
msgid "The R series is fitted with a jump drive."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:439
msgid ""
"Compared to its predecessor, the R5, the R7 has stronger shields and hull "
"but a slower turning rate."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:448
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Stalker R5"
msgstr "Stalker R5"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:456
msgid ""
"Compared to its successor, the R7, the R5 has weaker shields and hull but a "
"faster turning rate."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:466
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Ranus U"
msgstr "Ranus U"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:472
msgid ""
"The Ranus U sniper is built to deal large amounts of damage quickly at "
"distance before escaping. While it's the smallest frigate-class ship, it's "
"also one of the only frigate models to carry nukes in its standard "
"configuration."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:487
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Fiend G3"
msgstr "Fiend G3"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:493
msgid ""
"The first model produced by Conversions R Us, the Fiend G3 is simply a "
"decommissioned gunship hull with a cheap FTL drive installed. It has the "
"same homing missile tube and beams as a gunship to take down weaker ships, "
"but its FTL drive makes it a more dangerous foe."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:495
msgid "The G3 is fitted with a jump drive."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:511
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Fiend G4"
msgstr "Fiend G4"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:515
msgid ""
"The second model produced by Conversions R Us, the Fiend G4 is simply a "
"decommissioned gunship hull with a cheap FTL drive installed. It has the "
"same homing missile tube and beams as a gunship to take down weaker ships, "
"but its FTL drive makes it a more dangerous foe."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:517
msgid "The G4 is fitted with a warp drive."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:526
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Fiend G6"
msgstr "Fiend G6"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:530
#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:544
msgid ""
"Following the success of the Fiend G3 and G4, the Fiend G5 and G6 are simply "
"decommissioned advanced gunship hulls with a cheap FTL drive installed. It "
"has the same two homing missile tubes and beams as an advanced gunship to "
"take down weaker ships, but its FTL drive makes it a more dangerous foe."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:532
msgid "The G6 is fitted with a warp drive."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:540
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Fiend G5"
msgstr "Fiend G5"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:546
msgid "The G6 is fitted with a jump drive."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:554
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Blockade Runner"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/frigates.lua:560
msgid ""
"Blockade Runners are reasonably fast, highly shielded, slow-firing ships "
"designed to break through defensive lines and deliver goods."
msgstr ""

#~ msgctxt "subclass"
#~ msgid "Cruiser"
#~ msgstr "Kreuzer"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Phobos T3, just like the Atlantis, is the workhorse of almost any "
#~ "navy. It's extremely easy to modify, which makes retro-fitting this ship "
#~ "a breeze. Its basic stats aren't impressive, but due to its modular "
#~ "nature, it's fairly easy to produce in large quantities."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Wie die Atlantis wird auch die Phobos T3 fast überall als Arbeitstier "
#~ "eingesetzt. Sie lässt sich extrem einfach modifizieren, was einen Umbau "
#~ "für den jeweiligen Zweck extrem einfach macht Die technischen Daten sind "
#~ "nicht sonderlich beeindruckend, aber durch ihren modularen Aufbau lässt "
#~ "sie sich leicht in großen Stückzahlen herstellen."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Inspired by the Phobos T3 design, the Elara P2 is nearly identical. With "
#~ "the addition of a warp drive and stronger front shields, the Elara P2 "
#~ "poses a greater threat than the Phobos"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspiriert vom Design der Phobos T3, ist die Elara P2 nahezu identisch. "
#~ "Ausgestattet mit einen zusätzlichen Warpantrieb und stärkeren "
#~ "Frontschilden, ist die Elara P2 noch gefährlicher als die Phobos."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Player variant of the Phobos M3, not as strong as the atlantis, but has "
#~ "front firing tubes, making it an easier to use ship in some scenarios."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Spielbare Variante der Phobos M3. Nicht so stark wie die Atlantis, "
#~ "allerdings mit nach vorne gerichteten Waffenschächten, wodurch das Schiff "
#~ "in manchen Szenarios einfacher handzuhaben ist."

#~ msgctxt "subclass"
#~ msgid "Cruiser: Anti-fighter"
#~ msgstr "Kreuzer: Anti-Jäger"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Nirvana R5 is an anti-fighter cruiser. It has several rapid-firing, "
#~ "low-damage point-defense weapons to quickly take out starfighters."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Nirvana R5 ist ein Anti-Jäger-Kreuzer. Sie verfügt über mehrere "
#~ "leichte, schnell feuernde Nahbereichs-Verteidigungswaffen, um Jäger "
#~ "abzuwehren."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "An improved version of the Nirvana R5 with faster turning speed and "
#~ "firing rates."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Eine verbesserte Version der Nirvana R5A mit besserer Manövrierbarkeit "
#~ "und höherer Feuerrate."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "One of the earliest mass produced Nirvana models, the Nirvana R3 is "
#~ "designed to be used against fighters. It's got several fast, low damage, "
#~ "point defense beam weapons. Compared to the later, more common Nirvana "
#~ "R5, it has shorter beams, weaker shields and hull and a slower impulse "
#~ "drive."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Als eine der ersten in Massenproduktion hergestellten Nirvana-Modelle, "
#~ "ist die Nirvana R3 speziell für den Einsatz gegen Jäger ausgelegt. Sie "
#~ "besitzt mehrere schnelle und schwache Abwehrlaser. Verglichen mit der "
#~ "späteren, weiter verbreiteten Nirvana R5 haben die Laser eine kürzere "
#~ "Reichweite, außerdem sind Schilde und Impulsantrieb schwächer."

#~ msgctxt "subclass"
#~ msgid "Cruiser: Heavy Artillery"
#~ msgstr "Kreuzer:Schwere Artillerie"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A heavy artillery cruiser, the Storm fires bunches of missiles from "
#~ "forward facing tubes."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Als schwerer Artillerie-Kreuzer kann die Storm mehrere Raketen aus an der "
#~ "Front angebrachten Schächten abfeuern."

#~ msgctxt "subclass"
#~ msgid "Cruiser: Sniper"
#~ msgstr "Kreuzer: Sniper"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Long range narrow beam and some point defense beams, broadside missiles. "
#~ "Agile for a frigate"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ein schmaler Langstreckenlaser und einige Abwehrlaser, sowie "
#~ "Breitseitenraketen. Sehr wendig für eine Fregatte."

#~ msgctxt "subclass"
#~ msgid "Cruiser: Light Artillery"
#~ msgstr "Kreuzer: Leichte Artillerie"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A light artillery cruiser, the Piranha F12 is the smallest ship to "
#~ "exclusively fire from broadside weapon tubes."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Als leichter Artilleriekreuzer ist die Piranha F12 das kleinste Schiff, "
#~ "das ausschließlich über Breitseitenwaffen verfügt."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This modified Piranha F12 is in all respects the same vessel except for "
#~ "special weapon tube modifications that allow it to fire nukes in addition "
#~ "to its normal loadout. However, these changes reduce its overall missile "
#~ "storage capacity."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Diese modifizierte Piranha F12 ist im Prinzip mit dieser baugleich - "
#~ "abgesehen von einer Modifikation der Waffenschächte, welche es zusätzlich "
#~ "zur normalen Konfiguration erlaubt, auch Nukes zu verwenden. Allerdings "
#~ "verringert sich durch diese Veränderung auch die Gesamtkapazität der "
#~ "Munition."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The first version of the Piranha was not popular due to its meager "
#~ "firepower and odd tube configuration. The result was a huge financial "
#~ "failure."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Aufgrund der mageren Feuerkraft und der seltsamen Anordnung der "
#~ "Waffenschächte war diese erste Version der Piranha nicht gerade beliebt. "
#~ "Das Ergebnis war ein großer finanzieller Rückschlag."

#~ msgctxt "subclass"
#~ msgid "Cruiser: Strike ship"
#~ msgstr "Kreuzer: Angriffsschiff"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Stalker is a strike ship designed to swoop into battle, deal damage "
#~ "quickly, and get out fast. The Q7 model is fitted with a warp drive."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Stalker ist ein Angriffsschiff welches dafür ausgelegt ist, schnell "
#~ "in die Schlacht einzugreifen, schnell viel Schaden zu verursachen, und "
#~ "das Kampfgeschehen schnell wieder zu verlassen. Das Modell Q7 ist mit "
#~ "einem Warpantrieb ausgestattet."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The stalker Q5 predates the Stalker Q7. Like the Q7, the Q5 is designed "
#~ "to swoop into battle, deal damage quickly and retreat. Compared to the "
#~ "Q7, the Q5 has weaker shields and hull, but a faster turn speed"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Stalker Q5 ist das Vorgängermodell der Stalker Q7.Wie die Q7 ist sie "
#~ "dafür ausgelegt ist, schnell in die Schlacht einzugreifen, schnell viel "
#~ "Schaden zu verursachen, und das Kampfgeschehen schnell wieder zu "
#~ "verlassen. Verglichen mit der Q7 hat die Q5 schwächere Schilde und "
#~ "Hüllenstärke, aber eine höhere Wendigkeit."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Stalker is a strike ship designed to swoop into battle, deal damage "
#~ "quickly, and get out fast. The R7 model is fitted with a jump drive."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Stalker ist ein Angriffsschiff welches dafür ausgelegt schnell in die "
#~ "Schlacht einzugreifen, schnell viel Schaden zu verursachen, und das "
#~ "Kampfgeschehen schnell wieder zu verlassen. TDas Modell R7 ist mit einem "
#~ "Sprungantrieb ausgestattet."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The stalker R5 predates the Stalker R7. Like the R7, the R5 is designed "
#~ "to swoop into battle, deal damage quickly and retreat. Compared to the "
#~ "R7, the R5 has weaker shields and hull, but a faster turn speed"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Stalker R5 ist das Vorgängermodell der Stalker R7.Wie die R7 ist sie "
#~ "dafür ausgelegt ist, schnell in die Schlacht einzugreifen, schnell viel "
#~ "Schaden zu verursachen, und das Kampfgeschehen schnell wieder zu "
#~ "verlassen. Verglichen mit der R7 hat die R5 schwächere Schilde und "
#~ "Hüllenstärke, aber eine höhere Wendigkeit."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Ranus U sniper is built to deal a large amounts of damage quickly and "
#~ "from a distance before escaping. It's the only basic frigate that carries "
#~ "nuclear weapons, even though it's also the smallest of all frigate-class "
#~ "ships."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Ranus U wurde gebaut, um schnell und aus großer Entfernung viel "
#~ "Schaden zu verursachen und sich dann zurückzuziehen. Es ist die einzige "
#~ "Basis-Fregatte welche über Nuklearwaffen verfügt, obwohl es sich generell "
#~ "um die kleinste Fregatte handelt."

#~ msgctxt "ship"
#~ msgid "Flavia"
#~ msgstr "Flavia"

#~ msgctxt "subclass"
#~ msgid "Light transport"
#~ msgstr "Leichter Transporter"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Popular among traders and smugglers, the Flavia is a small cargo and "
#~ "passenger transport. It's cheaper than a freighter for small loads and "
#~ "short distances, and is often used to carry high-value cargo discreetly."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Flavia ist ein kleines Fracht- und Passagierschiff und sowohl unter "
#~ "Händlern als auch Schmugglern beliebt. Bei kleinerer Ladung und kuerzeren "
#~ "Strecken ist es günstiger als ein ein Frachter und wird oft genutzt um "
#~ "hochwertige Ware diskret zu transportieren."

#~ msgctxt "ship"
#~ msgid "Flavia Falcon"
#~ msgstr "Flavia Falcon"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Flavia Falcon is a Flavia transport modified for faster flight, and "
#~ "adds rear-mounted lasers to keep enemies off its back."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Flavia Falcon ist ein Flavia-Transporter welcher für höhere "
#~ "Geschwindigkeit optimiert wurde und besitzt zusätzlich zwei rückwärtige "
#~ "Laser um den Rücken von Feinden frei zu halten."

#~ msgctxt "playerShip"
#~ msgid "Flavia P.Falcon"
#~ msgstr "Flavia P.Falcon"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Flavia P.Falcon has a nuclear-capable rear-facing weapon tube and a "
#~ "warp drive."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Flavia P.Falcon besitzt einen rückwärtigen Raketenschacht welcher "
#~ "Nukes einsetzen kann, sowie einen Warpantrieb."

#~ msgctxt "playerShip"
#~ msgid "Repulse"
#~ msgstr "Repulse"

#~ msgctxt "subclass"
#~ msgid "Armored Transport"
#~ msgstr "Gepanzerter Transporter"

#~ msgid "Jump/Turret version of Flavia Falcon"
#~ msgstr "Sprung/Geschützturm-Version der Flavia Falcon"

#~ msgctxt "subclass"
#~ msgid "Gunship"
#~ msgstr "Kanonenboot"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Fiend G3 was the first model produced by Conversions R Us. They got a "
#~ "good deal on a number of used Gunships. They added a cheap jump drive to "
#~ "the Gunship and viola! they made the Fiend G3. Like the Gunship, it has a "
#~ "homing missile tube and beams to readily take down weaker ships. With the "
#~ "jump drive, it becomes quite a bit more dangerous than the stock Gunship."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Fiend G3 war das erste Modell das von Conversions R us produziert "
#~ "wurde. sie konnten eine Flotte gebrauchter Kanonenboote günstig "
#~ "ersteigern. Im wesentlichen baute die Firma einen günstigen Sprungantrieb "
#~ "in jedes Schiff ein und voila! Die Fiend G3 war geboren. Wie das "
#~ "Kanonenboot hat verfügt es über Zielsuchraketen und Laser um schwächere "
#~ "Schiffe auszuschalten. In Verbindung mit dem Sprungantrieb ist es im "
#~ "Vergleich zum normalen Kanonenboot das wesentlich gefährlichere Schiff."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The Fiend G4 was among the first models produced by Conversions R Us. "
#~ "They got a good deal on a number of used Gunships. They added a cheap "
#~ "warp drive to the Gunship and viola! they made the Fiend G4. Like the "
#~ "Gunship, it has a homing missile tube and beams to readily take down "
#~ "weaker ships. With the warp drive, it becomes quite a bit more dangerous "
#~ "than the stock Gunship."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Die Fiend G4 war eines der ersten Modelle das von Conversions R us "
#~ "produziert wurde. Sie konnten eine Flotte gebrauchter Kanonenboote "
#~ "günstig ersteigern. Im wesentlichen baute die Firma einen günstigen "
#~ "Warpantrieb in jedes Schiff ein und voila! die Fiend G4 war geboren. Wie "
#~ "das Kanonenboot hat verfügt es über Zielsuchraketen und Laser um "
#~ "schwächere Schiffe auszuschalten. In Verbindung mit dem Warpantrieb ist "
#~ "es im Vergleich zum normalen Kanonenboot das wesentlich gefährlichere "
#~ "Schiff."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "With the success of the Fiend G3 and G4 models, Conversions R Us "
#~ "continued their streak with the Fiend G6. They acquired some used "
#~ "Advanced Gunships and added cheap warp drives to them and made the Fiend "
